WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.630
Nanaka's dance at the Yatsushiro Temple was so beautiful.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:11.220
Her dance under the night sky, illuminated by the lights, was really surreal.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:14.430
It was like a dream.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:20.940
After the dance, I met Nanaka behind the temple. She seems to have returned to her old self.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.930
And... how do I put it?

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:25.180
How do you put what?

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.400
What is it?

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.610
No, it's...

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.870
What is it?

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:31.040
Well, like I was saying...

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:36.760
Putting that aside, I was more worried about the violin thing.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.710
You're trying to trick us.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:43.650
Why didn't Nanaka play the violin back then?

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.550
She used to love playing the violin so much back then.

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:48.940
Well, that's...

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:52.110
Nevermind that. The festival was really fun, wasn't it?

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:56.050
That's right. It really had a festival feel to it!

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.990
Huh? Are you guys trying to hide something from me?

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:09.200
I'm an Adult

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:28.490
Eight, nine, ten...

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:30.530
Eleven!

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:36.000
Same as me!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.000
Dear Hinako-chan,

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.000
due to work

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.000
I have to go

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.000
on a business trip

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.000
on short notice.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.040
From,                            Mama

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.040
I'll be back tomorrow night.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.550
Choose small button.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.550
Choose big button.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.150
Yes, coming!

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.430
Oh, Hinako, it's just you. What's up?

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.970
Why are you standing there like a rock?

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:31.840
I'm going to change right now, so get out!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.740
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.590
Hey, why in the world...?

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:43.670
Sorry!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.530
Idiot, pervert, pedophile!

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:51.790
You ran from home?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:55.420
You're so loud. What are you so surprised for?

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.110
It's only normal to be surprised, right?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.930
But why?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.960
It's none of your concern now, is it?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:08.210
No, when you barge into someone's house, I think it would concern them.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:12.890
What's up with that? It's as if my being here is a problem.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.890
It <i>is</i> a problem!

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:16.790
What problem?

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:21.090
A beautiful maiden like me will be staying under one roof with you.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.280
You should be grateful, hmph!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:25.900
Why you...!

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.830
Sana-chan!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.380
I made too much for the side dish, so I...

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:44.580
I'm sorry. After opening the door and seeing something like that...

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:49.090
And on top of that, you two were on the bed, so again, I thought for certain...

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.810
What do you mean by again?!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.120
What?! You ran from home?!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:57.070
You can't, Hina-chan! The people in your house will be worried!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:00.490
It's fine. I left a note.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.100
And I told them where I was going too.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:06.000
I see. That's certainly true.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.470
You should be safe in Sana's place.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:12.200
I can't accept that!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:19.090
If you run into any problems, feel free to tell me, okay?

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.050
Sure, onee-sama.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.250
What are you doing?

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:28.150
You can see for yourself, right? My homework.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:33.620
You should be studying too instead of pondering your response.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.740
You'll be having your exams next year, right?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.710
<b>The value of x and y when they intersect.</b>

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.710
<b>Please solve the equation.</b>

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:51.130
You've been making those creepy noises for a while. What are you doing?

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:54.430
It's just that I don't understand this problem.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.380
Let me see.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.490
The value of x and y when they intersect. Please solve...

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:04.830
You don't even understand something like this?!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.700
Do you understand it, Hinako?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.470
Of course! This is the basics of basics.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:16.620
You don't even understand something like that going into Year 2. This really is the lazy generation.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.310
I have no excuse.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.950
I'm back!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:29.200
Where did you go?

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.230
Shopping for dinner.

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.210
Hinako, don't tell me that you're...

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:47.360
Yep. Since I'll be in your care for a while, I thought I should at least make dinner.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.440
I appreciate the gesture, but...

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:04.180
Human life is at stake, so you should improve your cooking first...

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:08.650
Don't exaggerate! I've gotten better since last time.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.160
At least the colour has become normal.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.050
Of course!

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:18.840
As the saying goes, “Watch a man carefully as he can improve quickly after three days.”

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.790
But, you're a girl.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:24.130
Forget about that! Hurry up and eat!

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.670
Fine.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.470
Itadakimasu.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.560
Thank you very much.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:48.280
You didn't have to order a kid's meal too.

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.740
But, you managed to collect all the mascots from that.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.030
Don't complain.

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.590
Yeah, that's true.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:13.770
I'm going to take a bath now. If you peek like when I was changing earlier, I'm going to kill you. Got it?

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.500
That was an accident and wasn't on purpose.

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.100
Anyway, you musn't peek!

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:38.650
Okay, this is to get her contact information.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.730
I'm not trying to do anything dirty.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.300
<i>Hide your panties somewhere deeper inside!</i>

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.560
<i>Oh yeah. It should be there.</i>

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.630
Here it is.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.920
Mochida Hinako

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.510
Hello?

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.820
<i>The person you have called is currently unavailable.</i>

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:21.010
<i>Please leave a message after the beep.</i>

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.730
Umm, I'm Hidaka Sana.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.800
I'm a Year 2 student from Sakuranomori High.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:33.320
I'm currently taking care of your daughter.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.270
I mean, I didn't kidnap her.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:41.430
It's true. I'm not a suspicious person.

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:45.290
Your daughter came to my place and...

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.910
<i>Hinako's birthday is today.</i>

00:09:04.800 --> 00:09:09.180
Hello? Aoi-chan? Actually, I need your help.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:19.410
Let's sleep soon.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:25.940
Just to inform you, I've only got one bed.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.690
I can see that!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.450
Well, good night.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:39.830
Hey.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.470
Hurry and turn off the lights. I can't sleep like this!

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.640
Are you asleep?

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.620
You can come here.

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:10.390
What are you saying?

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.770
Stupid, don't get the wrong idea! It's not like that!

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.330
It's not like that. It's just that...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.360
Well, as a replacement for my plushie...

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:34.880
I have a really big Yeti-kun plushie at home.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:42.640
Papa... the person who was my papa, bought it as a birthday present for me.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.680
It's my favourite.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:48.100
And I always sleep with it.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.620
Actually, I wanted to bring it along.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:56.350
But, it's too big and also, I'm no longer a kid.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:59.820
I thought that I would be fine without a plushie.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:06.120
But, I guess I really can't sleep without it.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.960
So, can you be the replacement?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:13.630
Please don't... Please don't tell anyone.

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:17.330
I understand. I won't tell anyone.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:21.450
I see. Thank you.

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.250
How long are you going stay asleep?

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.370
Time to get up. Hey, Hinako!

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:55.530
You're finally awake.

00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.820
Why are you in my room?!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:09.220
Honestly, you come barging into my house and this is what you do?

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:13.170
What can I do? I wasn't fully aware when I woke up.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:17.360
Anyway, eat quickly. We're going out after this.

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.370
Where are you going this Sunday morning?

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:21.580
Shopping.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.920
I see, then have a nice trip.

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.830
You're coming along too!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.620
<i>Stare...</i>

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:43.720
Shuri-chan, the location of the target has been confirmed. Commencing operation.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.930
You want to pick out a present for a girl?

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:54.690
I'm not very good with such things, so I was hoping to get some advice.

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:58.780
So that's what you wanted. You should have just told me earlier.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:03.450
So, who's the girl? Is it Nanaka-san?

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:10.880
I guess not. Nanaka-san is pretty and would be a poor match with you.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.780
Really?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.210
If it isn't Nanaka-san, then...

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.460
Don't tell me it's Aoi-onee-sama?

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:20.890
If it is, then I won't help!

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:22.360
It isn't.

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:24.360
Then, who is she?

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.960
Does it matter?

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:31.350
It does. If I don't know who she is, then I won't be able to pick out a present.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:33.380
That's true...

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.670
She's audacious, foul-mouthed and selfish.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:40.490
What the heck? She doesn't even have one good point.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:44.300
That's not true. She has plenty of cute points too.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.810
Well, I can't question another person's tastes.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:53.150
But, I think I know what to get.

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.060
Then...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.620
Yeah. Just leave the choice to me.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:05.470
Let's start with the ladies' goods floor then.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.790
This one is pretty nice, isn't it?

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:13.700
But, it's a little childish, isn't it?

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.990
It's okay. She's the audacious type, isn't she?

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:19.640
She's probably an adult on the outisde, but unexpectedly childish inside.

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.720
I see. That's true.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:22.720
Right?

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:38.410
What is it?

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:40.330
Sorry, it's an e-mail.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:42.430
Where are you now?

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:47.850
<b>4th floor  Place selling clocks</b>

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:47.850
{fad(250,0)\bord0\shad0\pos(404,457)\c&H727971&\b1\fs40\frz8.5}Sana

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:48.430
<b>Sending</b>

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.760
How's this one?

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.850
Which one?

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.670
This one, the cute baby chick.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:57.680
I'm sure it will move its wings when it's time.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.600
It's kinda expensive.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.600
Why are you being so stingy?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:08.110
It's a present for a girl after all. You should put a lot into it!

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:11.100
What should I do?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.050
So, what's your decision?

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:17.510
If it isn't Sana-kun.

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:18.380
Shuu?

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.850
Shuusuke-san!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:24.410
My, how unexpected to meet in a place like this.

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:27.660
<i>It seems pretty intentional to me.</i>

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:31.000
<i>And I told you to come dressed smartly!</i>

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:36.590
This is really unexpected! Are you shopping too?

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:39.020
Yeah, something like that.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:43.570
<i>I guess it's okay since she bought it.</i>

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:49.860
By the way, shopping alone together on a Sunday... Are you guys on a date?

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:56.710
No, I'm only with him because he wanted my help to pick out a present.

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:57.700
Present?

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.390
Well, actually...

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:06.240
I see, so you found something you like but your budget is a little short?

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:11.970
Okay, in that case, I'll pay half with my knightly compassion.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:14.610
As expected from Shuusuke-san!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.300
You don't have to say it like that.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.370
You were really a great help today.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.310
Since it's about lunch time, let me buy you lunch.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.820
Really? How lucky!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:32.260
Then let's watch a movie after lunch.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:33.820
There's a movie I'd like to see.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:03.470
So, you've never been to his room before, Shuusuke-san?

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:06.850
Yeah. So, I thought I'd tag along and take a look.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:09.650
You shouldn't, it's a boring place.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.530
That may be true, but I don't want to hear it from you!

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.030
Hey, it's dark, so turn on the lights.

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:24.790
Hina-chan, Happy 11th Birthday!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:26.540
Hinako.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:29.180
It may be a day late, but...

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:31.300
...this is a present from us.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:34.300
So, you planned this right from the start?

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:40.760
C'mon, the party can't start if the main star keeps on standing around.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:43.920
The main star sits here.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.480
Did you make this?

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:51.820
Yep, I prepared the cake and all the food.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:56.410
Here, mine is an overnight stay set pouch.

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.320
Thank you, Shuri-san.

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:02.090
Thank goodness your present wasn't handmade by my sister.

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.860
It'd be bad if it were.

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:07.810
Keep your mouth shut when you don't need to say anything.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.580
And mine.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.660
Wow, thanks.

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.590
Uhh...

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:19.430
The cookies are supposed to look like Yeti-kun, but...

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.990
I guess it didn't turn out so good.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.600
It's kinda scary.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:27.660
Well, it'd be hard to eat if it were too cute.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.010
It's better this way.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:58.130
I'm finished.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:01.050
Damnit! I lose again?

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:03.480
Your expression is too obvious.

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:11.150
Umm, Hinako...

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:14.620
I know. I should be getting home soon, right?

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:19.990
Sorry. I know I've caused you a lot of trouble.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:21.600
No, well...

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:30.180
Thank you all. I've never had such a fun birthday before.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:36.600
It was so much fun that I just didn't want to go home.

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:39.330
So, I'm going to go now then.

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:41.590
Hinako.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:45.440
You don't have to worry about me.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.850
I'm already an adult after all.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:52.680
Alright, let's end this with a bang then!

00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:54.590
That's nice, karaoke!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:57.860
Let's call it a night after everyone sings a song then.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:35.470
Here is fine. My house is right after this traffic light.

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.860
Then, here's your stuff.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.580
Well...

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.870
You're welcome to come over to my place anytime.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:54.900
Well then...

00:20:57.630 --> 00:20:59.100
I almost forgot.

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.760
Hello, I'm the homeroom teacher, Fujimura Yuzuki.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.750
You say I sound strange? Have I been drinking?

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.700
No, I haven't been drinking! I'm working!

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:37.950
No matter how much I love drinking, I can't because I'm working right now!

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:40.250
What? I have to do the preview quickly?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.500
I know, I know! Now, where am I up to on the script...?

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.450
Here?

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:49.090
Next time on Myself; Yourself:
Teacher's Caramel

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:53.170
If you watch, teacher will give a reward.

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:55.030
Teacher's Caramel

00:21:53.170 --> 00:21:54.730
Just kidding!
